// The site's plan tier lights (public/brand/light/tier-light-*.webp): each plan's pre-made light, an ice field with the brand
// light at its right edge, and its black twin (where the light is darkest, a mask for the ASCII glyphs that drift in it).
// Also the ASCII texture's alpha tile (public/brand/textures/ascii-texture-alpha@2x.webp): the glyphs on transparent.
// Both flavors of the pricing table read this file.
export type PlanLight = 'free' | 'creator' | 'pro' | 'enterprise'
